# Task Manager — Factory Upgrade (Canonical)
# Format: TOON — managed via manage.sh
# Usage:  .factory/task-manager/manage.sh list|add|start|complete

summary:
  completed: 5
    - us_099_final_integration:
        summary: "Final validation: tsc --noEmit passes clean. All P0/P1 tasks implemented. Factory engine upgrade complete with tool-calling loop, TOON bridge, minions engine, CLI facade, and bridge initialization."
    - us_061_agents_md_patch:
        summary: "Added to initBridge: finds agents.md/AGENTS.md, generates from template if missing, appends Factory Agentic Scaffold section if exists. Never overwrites existing content."
    - us_060_init_bridge_engine:
        summary: "Created engine/init.ts with initBridge(repoPath): creates .factory/ scaffold (factory.yaml, skill-index.toon, context.toon, worklog.toon, heartbeat.toon, todo.toon, workflows/). Auto-detects stack from package.json/tsconfig.json. Returns InitResult with list of files created."
    - us_031_032_minions_engine:
        summary: "Created engine/minions-engine.ts with specToQueueYaml() (5-step AppSpec, 6-step FeatureSpec) and runMinionsEngine() (spawn, stream, return BuildResult). Added runMinionsBuild and runMinionsFeatureBuild exports for cli.ts integration."
    - us_030_delete_old_engines:
        summary: "Deleted gemini-cli-engine.ts and pi-cli-engine.ts. Updated BuildEngine type to factory|minions. Replaced engine-specific code in cli.ts with minions stubs (to be implemented in us_031_032)."
    - us_023_heartbeat_on_queue:
        summary: "Added writeHeartbeat() call in markRunning() with try/catch. Imports writeHeartbeat from toon.ts."
    - us_021_gather_toon_context:
        summary: "Added gatherToonSnapshot() to context.ts. Reads .factory/context/context.toon and .factory/skill-index.toon. Added toonSnapshot and projectSkills to ProjectContext in types.ts. Called inside gatherContext()."
    - us_020_toon_helpers:
        summary: "Created engine/toon.ts with readToonFile, compressToon, parseToonSkillIndex, writeHeartbeat, writeToonTasksSnapshot. Uses @toon-format/toon for encode/decode."
    - us_013_tool_system_prompt:
        summary: "Added buildToolSystemPrompt(spec, context) to generate.ts. Includes role, RULES, REASON CODES, TOON context block, spec YAML, skills table."
    - us_012_tool_calling_loop:
        summary: "Added runToolSession() to generate.ts. Max 30 turns, token guard trims to last 15 msgs at 20+. Calls LLM with tool definitions, executes tools via executeTool(), stops on ctx.terminal. Replaces runPipeline/runFeaturePipeline bodies."
    - us_011_tool_executor:
        summary: "Added async executeTool(name, args, ctx) to build-tools.ts. Errors returned as {content, isError}. run_command timeout:120000. mark_complete/mark_failed set ctx.terminal=true."
    - us_010_build_tool_schema:
        summary: "Created engine/build-tools.ts with 9 TOOL_DEFINITIONS (read_file, write_file, list_dir, run_command, read_spec, read_context, log_step, mark_complete, mark_failed) in OpenAI function-call format. Exported BuildToolContext and ToolResult types."
