    - us_000_fix_heartbeat_path: "Verified pulse.sh uses .factory/context/ (already fixed in us_001). Removed stale .agents/ directory. Added .agents/ to .gitignore." [P0 factory/scripts/heartbeat/pulse.sh]
    - us_001_copy_scripts: "Copied 6 skill scripts from ag-starter to factory/scripts/, adapted paths (.agents/ → .factory/), fixed macOS UTC date bug in check.sh, added @toon-format/toon dep, fixed tsc errors in pi-cli-engine.ts and cli.ts imports, updated skill-index.toon." [P1 factory/scripts/]
    - us_002_factory_scaffold: "Created factory/.factory/ structure: context/, task-manager/, workflows/, knowledge/. Updated AGENTS.md with role, stack, quick commands." [P1 factory/.factory/]
    - us_003_factory_yaml_schema: "Added factory_home and agentic fields to BridgeConfig in types.ts. Updated config.ts. Added resolveScript(scriptName) and hasScript(scriptName) helpers in cli.ts." [P1 engine/types.ts engine/config.ts engine/cli.ts]
    - us_004_cli_facade: "Added CLI facade subcommands: pulse, task, context update, compress, minions, hooks install. Each resolves script via resolveScript() and spawns with FACTORY_PROJECT_ROOT env var." [P1 engine/cli.ts]

  next:
    - us_005_write_factory_yaml: "factory.yaml is missing from .factory/ despite us_002 completing — write it now. Content: version:1, factory_home:'.', agentic:{context_dir:.factory/context, task_queue:.factory/task-manager/todo.toon, skill_index:.factory/skill-index.toon, workflows_dir:.factory/workflows, knowledge_dir:.factory/knowledge}. Verify config.ts loadBridgeConfig() reads it correctly." [P0 .factory/factory.yaml engine/config.ts]
    - us_006_task_summary_qa: "todo.toon summary: block must always stay in sync with actual completed/next counts. Add a validate-todo.sh script to factory/scripts/task-manager/ that checks counts match reality and warns if in_progress block has orphaned entries. Run as part of factory validate." [P1 factory/scripts/task-manager/]
    - us_014_build_tool_ui: "Real-time tool call timeline in build panel — name, args, duration, outcome. SSE stream from API." [P2 ui/src/components/ ui/src/app/api/build-events/]
    - us_022_write_tasks_toon: "In engine/writer.ts writeKnowledgeEntry(): call writeToonTasksSnapshot() after knowledge .md write." [P2 engine/writer.ts engine/toon.ts]
    - us_024_human_toon_input: "manage.sh add auto-slugifies summary into task ID, appends to next: in todo.toon. writeToonTasksSnapshot() in writer.ts preserves human-added tasks (those not matching any spec slug) when Factory overwrites todo.toon." [P2 factory/scripts/task-manager/ engine/writer.ts]
    - us_033_034_engine_field: "Add engine field to AppSpec/FeatureSpec. Validate in spec.ts. Route in cli.ts. Add DB column. factory queue add --engine flag." [P2 engine/types.ts engine/spec.ts engine/cli.ts engine/db.ts]
    - us_040_043_workflows_hooks: "Verify .factory/workflows/ script paths. Create factory/scripts/heartbeat/setup-hooks.sh — pre-commit (in_progress check + heartbeat warn) + post-commit (factory pulse + context update)." [P2 factory/scripts/heartbeat/]
    - us_050_ui_heartbeat: "API /api/heartbeat reads heartbeat.toon per project. HeartbeatMonitor.tsx — shadcn Table, 30s poll, status dots." [P3 ui/src/components/HeartbeatMonitor.tsx]
    - us_051_052_ui_context_skills: "API /api/toon-context and /api/skills. ToonContextViewer.tsx and SkillRegistry.tsx components." [P3 ui/src/]
    - us_053_ui_engine_badge: "Engine Badge on queue list: factory=blue, minions=purple. Engine-specific build panel view." [P3 ui/src/components/]
    - us_062_project_init_ui: "UI onboarding wizard for Add Project: replace simple path input with a 2-step modal — Step 1: enter repo path + auto-detect stack preview; Step 2: init progress panel streaming file creation results via SSE (/api/project/init). Show per-file status (created/skipped/patched), agents.md outcome (Created/Patched), git-hooks toggle. 'Open in dashboard' button when done. Use shadcn Dialog, Progress, Badge, Switch." [P2 ui/src/components/ ui/src/app/api/project/init/]

    - us_070_queue_daemon: "Upgrade factory queue start into a persistent daemon mode (factory queue daemon). After processing all pending items, enter a watch loop polling SQLite every 30s for new items. Never exits unless killed. On startup: write heartbeat, log 'Factory daemon active'. On idle: log 'Waiting for work...' every 5 min. On new item found: immediately dequeue and build. Wrap in try/catch — a single build failure must NOT crash the daemon." [P1 engine/queue.ts engine/cli.ts]
    - us_071_auto_retry: "On build failure (non-zero exit, tsc errors, unresolvable): auto-retry up to spec-configurable maxRetries (default 2) with exponential back-off (60s, 120s). After maxRetries: mark item failed, write failure summary to .factory/knowledge/failures/{slug}.md, continue processing next item. Never block the queue on a single failing spec." [P1 engine/queue.ts engine/generate.ts]
    - us_072_daemon_process_mgr: "factory daemon start — spawns queue daemon as a detached background process, writes PID to .factory/daemon.pid. factory daemon stop — kills PID. factory daemon status — reads PID + heartbeat.toon to report running|stalled|stopped. factory daemon restart — stop + start. On macOS: also generate a launchd plist at factory daemon install for boot-time auto-start." [P1 engine/cli.ts engine/daemon.ts]
    - us_073_spec_watcher: "factory queue watch <dir> — watches a specs directory for new .yaml files. When a new file appears: validate it, enqueue it, log 'Enqueued: {slug}'. Daemon picks it up within 30s. Enables a full drop-and-build workflow: drop a spec file, Factory does the rest." [P1 engine/cli.ts engine/queue.ts]
    - us_074_daemon_ui: "Factory dashboard shows daemon status prominently: green pulse animation when running, grey when stopped, red when stalled. 'Start Daemon' / 'Stop Daemon' buttons. Live build feed: SSE stream from /api/daemon/events showing current item, queue depth, ETA, recent completions. Auto-refreshes without page reload." [P2 ui/src/components/DaemonStatusPanel.tsx ui/src/app/api/daemon/]

